---
import { ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro'
import { site } from '../config/site'
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro'
---
<section class="section lab-section" id="lab" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-topline"><SectionHeading label="THE LAB" title="One Human. AI in the Loop." id="lab-title" /><span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">01 / 03</span></div>
    <div class="lab-grid">
      <div class="body-copy lab-copy">
        <h3>TechBook: an experiment in the future of software engineering.</h3>
        <p>What happens when one experienced business and technology leader uses AI to undertake work traditionally shared across a software engineering team?</p>
        <p>TechBook is my practical experiment in building software with AI supporting analysis, architecture, engineering, testing and deployment.</p>
        <p>The goal isn't to prove that AI can replace people. It's to understand how AI changes the economics, capabilities and operating models of technology delivery, and where human expertise, judgement and accountability remain essential.</p>
        <p>I'm documenting the journey: the decisions, architecture, tools, experiments, mistakes, costs and lessons learned.</p>
        <p><strong>Explore the project documentation or follow the experiment on Substack.</strong></p>
        <div class="button-group lab-actions">
          <span class="lab-action-tooltip">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/lab/techbook/" aria-describedby="techbook-link-description">See the experiment unfold <ArrowUpRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
            <span class="lab-tooltip-text" id="techbook-link-description" role="tooltip">Explore the TechBook article and project resources, including documents, diagrams and AI skills as they are published.</span>
          </span>
          <a class="button button-text" href={site.labSection} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow the Experiment on Substack <ArrowUpRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-visual">
        <div class="lab-preview" aria-label="TechBook operating principle: Human First, AI in the Loop">
          <div class="preview-header"><span>TECHBOOK / OPERATING PRINCIPLE</span><span class="preview-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
          <div class="preview-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="diagram-orbit orbit-outer"></div><div class="diagram-orbit orbit-inner"></div>
            <div class="diagram-center"><span>OPERATING PRINCIPLE</span><strong>Human First.</strong><span>AI in the Loop.</span></div>
            <span class="diagram-point point-one"></span><span class="diagram-point point-two"></span><span class="diagram-point point-three"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="preview-footer"><span>DEFINE. DESIGN. DELIVER. DEFEND.</span><a href="/lab/techbook/">Explore the TechBook project <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
